[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/comments/6275493549","html_url":"https://github.com/flutter/flutter/issues/194636#issuecomment-6275493549","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/194636","id":6275493549,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAeUeuM8AAAABdgxurQ","user":{"login":"mbcorona","id":14170258,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTcwMjU4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14170258?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbcorona","html_url":"https://github.com/mbcorona","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbcorona/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbcorona/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbcorona/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbcorona/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbcorona/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbcorona/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbcorona/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbcorona/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbcorona/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-19T19:28:33Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T19:28:33Z","body":"Hi @aerotech-vadb, thanks for the thorough trace. Confirmed on master: disable() nulls lastEditingState (text_field.dart:163) and enable() only restores it when it is non null (text_editing.dart:1993), so the re-created empty input is never corrected, which matches your steps 2 and 3.\n\nThis is in the same web semantics text field area as #194548 and #194186, but it is a distinct data loss rather than just an empty value exposed to AT, so keeping it separate. Routing to team-accessibility.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/comments/6275493549/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/comments/6321140994","html_url":"https://github.com/flutter/flutter/issues/194636#issuecomment-6321140994","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/194636","id":6321140994,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAeUeuM8AAAABeMT1Ag","user":{"login":"flutter-zl","id":205370234,"node_id":"U_kgDODD2zeg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/205370234?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/flutter-zl","html_url":"https://github.com/flutter-zl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flutter-zl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flutter-zl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flutter-zl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flutter-zl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flutter-zl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flutter-zl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flutter-zl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flutter-zl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flutter-zl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-21T16:33:55Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T16:33:55Z","body":"- **Demo**: https://flutter-demo-07-before.web.app. The reporter's sample with a label and app bar added. Semantics is on at startup, no placeholder click needed.\n  - **Steps**: in desktop Chrome, click the text field, which holds `hello`, and optionally type ` world`. Scroll the list down with the mouse wheel until the field is off-screen, then scroll back up.\n  - **Bug**: the field is empty and the bottom bar reads `controller.text = \"\"`. The field is still focused, so the next keystroke continues from the empty value. Fixed: the field still shows `hello world` and the bottom bar matches.\n  - **Control**: the same steps with semantics off keep the text. A `MutationObserver` on `<body>` shows the `<input>` after the round trip is a new element with `value=\"\"`, matching the issue's trace.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flutter/flutter/issues/comments/6321140994/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]